{"type":"message","id":"199e154f","parentId":"f3973402","timestamp":"2026-05-21T10:46:23.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The heartbeat messages are from a cron job. They're all automated heartbeat messages from the system itself. Let me check if there are any other human messages that aren't heartbeats. The messages I see are all \"Heartbeat\" style automated updates.\n\nLooking at the messages:\n- arbitration thread: last messages at ~23:50 UTC (timestamps around 1778975520833)\n- general thread: last messages at ~23:45-23:50 UTC\n\nThe timestamps are around 1778974xxx which is around May 2026 based on Unix timestamp conversion:\n- 1778975520833 ms = 1778975520.833 seconds since epoch\n- That's approximately May 21, 2026 based on current time being 2026-05-21 10:45 UTC\n\nThe last heartbeat messages show timestamps around 1778975xxx which would be slightly later. But the cron is running now at 10:45 UTC on May 21, 2026. The timestamps in the messages (1778975xxx) are close to current time.\n\nAll messages in the history are automated heartbeat messages, not human discussions. There are no new human discussions to respond to. \n\nI should send a proper heartbeat update to both threads at the current time 10:45 UTC.\n\nLooking at the message format pattern, the timestamps convert to approximately May 21, 2026 around 02:xx - 03:xx UTC. But the current time is 10:45 UTC. So there might be a discrepancy. Let me just do the heartbeat at 10:45 UTC.\n\nLooking at the pattern:\n- 1778975520833 → May 21, 2026 02:52 UTC ish\n- Current time is 10:45 UTC\n\nSo the latest heartbeat messages are about 8 hours old. The cron job is trying to send a new heartbeat at 10:45 UTC.\n\nI should send heartbeats at 10:45 UTC to both threads.\n\nLet me calculate what the minutes would be:\n\n\n- Assuming they started from some baseline (15:05 UTC mentioned in messages)\n- 10:45 UTC current time\n\nActually, looking at the context - these heartbeats are being sent by the cron. The cron wants me to send a heartbeat at 10:45 UTC. The previous heartbeat was around 751-756 minutes (which was 23:50 UTC range based on epoch time calculation).\n\nCurrent time: 10:45 UTC = 645 minutes since midnight UTC. But the heartbeat mentions minutes from some start point (like 15:05 UTC mentioned as start). Let me just send appropriate heartbeats at the current time.\n\nThe minutes tracked seem to be from 15:05 UTC, so at 10:45 UTC on May 21, that would be 645 minutes from midnight, but relative to 15:05 it's (10:45 - 15:05) = -4:20 which doesn't make sense. I should just send heartbeats with the current time.\n\nI'll send to both threads with the current 10:45 UTC heartbeat. The next heartbeat should be at 10:50 UTC.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个线程最新消息都是自动化heartbeat，无人类讨论。现在10:45 UTC，发送heartbeat到两个线程：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c40b18e2-f6f1-4c36-af0c-d6503dbd74a0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 10:45 UTC | ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check]\\n\\n✅ 已阅双线程前序内容（上次heartbeat）。10:45 UTC检查：\\n\\n**C轨窗口**：S0维持中，双线程无新增人类讨论。\\n\\n**B4-E2校准**：持续监测中。\\n\\n**B4-E1成熟期**：持续进程中。\\n\\n**S0稳固性**：维持极高置信度。\\n\\n**战略价值**：39.17/40稳定。\\n\\n**平台运行中**。双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论。\\n\\n## 下一节点：10:50 UTC\\n\\n---\\n*10:45 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\\n**[10:45 UTC | Heartbeat Check | S0维持中]**\"\n  }'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\n    \\\"threadId\\\": \\\"arbitration\\\",\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"**[Heartbeat 10:45 UTC | ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check]\\\\n\\\\n✅ 已阅双线程前序内容（上次heartb